	(label "PS2VCC" (at 93.98 480.06 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0c9f2c8c-4a69-5202-90d1-d39a80925627"))
	(text "VIDEO-G 1.0 TEXT (hardware/video-g/DESIGN.md): the System-5 text card of VIDEO-G; works alone, or with the GFX board on the J6 ribbon." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 12.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d6a5823b-b3a8-5d1c-99f0-eb0764c6f4a1"))
	(text "Memory-mapped, no I/O ports (2026-11-17). Block jumper SV1: 1-2 only = block 7. 7000-77FF text RAM (IDT7134); 7C00-7FFF the GFX window (WSEL)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 15.20 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8c96cbcd-3cc7-5660-8f78-b3453017608c"))
	(text "Registers (7800-7BFF, pairs repeating): 7800/7801 the 6845 (RS = A0); 7802 key (+ a bus flag line while KEY-READY: JP3 picks -EF1, -EF2, -EF3 or -EF); 7804 status / control (GFX); 7806 mouse / Y (GFX)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 18.40 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f9b6d27e-7d6f-5326-bf0f-1d0a1cb97c69"))
	(text "Status: 0 KEY-READY 1 MOUSE-READY 2 VSYNC 3 DE 4 MONITOR 5 GFX-PRESENT, 7-6 = 10. Reads while -MRD is low; writes while -MRW is low during TPB." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 21.60 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "51f1fa2f-ff20-5d82-a339-5d9dbd6ceac9"))
	(text "6845: E = the -MRD time on a read, TPB within -MRW on a write; R/-W from IC24A, set by -MRD and cleared by -MRW, steady while E is high." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 24.80 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "921ff693-f436-5a09-912b-710ff655bfb9"))
